+# OPERATOR FREEZE RUNBOOK — Sovereign V12 Blue Prince Repro Hub
+
+Audience: **Operator only.** The Policy Agent never performs these steps; the
+runbook exists so the Operator can freeze a baseline without ambiguity. Nothing
+here commits, pushes, tags, or authorizes release on its own.
+
+## 0. Absolute constraints
+
+- Do not commit, push, tag, or freeze unless you are the Operator.
+- Do not create `audit/BOOTSTRAP_ANCHOR.txt` until every pre-freeze check passes.
+- Never insert a digest, anchor, signature, or approval you did not compute or
+  receive through the proper role channel.
+
+## 1. Pre-freeze checklist
+
+Run all of the following from the repository root and confirm every item passes:
+
+```bash
+# 1. Review the baseline package contents
+ls -la baseline/
+
+# 2. Policy tests (7/7 required)
+opa test policy/ -v
+
+# 3. Schema and gate tests
+python3 -m pytest tests/ -v
+
+# 4. Skill frontmatter validation (5/5 required)
+python3 scripts/validate_skills.py
+
+# 5. Release gate fail-closed self-test: placeholder MUST deny
+python3 tools/release/gate_check.py examples/placeholder_evidence_bundle.json
+# expected: "DENY: ..." and exit code 1
+```
+
+If any step fails, stop. Fix, re-run. Never freeze a failing tree.
+
+## 2. Git init / clone procedure
+
+- **Fresh machine:** `git clone <remote>` then `git checkout <branch-to-freeze>`.
+- **No repo yet:** `git init`, add the remote, then commit the working tree per §3.
+- Confirm clean state: `git status` shows no unintended modifications.
+
+## 3. Commit procedure
+
+```bash
+git add -A
+git status                 # human review: only intended files
+git commit -m "freeze: baseline candidate <YYYY-MM-DD>"
+```
+
+Rules: one commit per freeze candidate; commit message contains no claims of
+certification (no "SLSA L3", no "production ready").
+
+## 4. HEAD SHA capture
+
+```bash
+git rev-parse HEAD
+```
+
+Record the printed SHA-256/SHA-1 commit id in the freeze declaration (§6). The
+baseline anchor is the hex digest of this commit as recorded by the Operator.
+
+## 5. `audit/BOOTSTRAP_ANCHOR.txt` (Operator only)
+
+Created **only** after §1–§4 pass. Suggested content:
+
+```
+BOOTSTRAP ANCHOR — Sovereign V12 Blue Prince Repro Hub
+created_by: <operator identity>
+created_at: <RFC 3339 timestamp>
+head_commit: <git rev-parse HEAD output>
+anchor_digest: <sha256 of the frozen tree per MASTER_ARTIFACT.md procedure>
+previous_anchor: none
+```
+
+## 6. Freeze declaration template
+
+```
+FREEZE DECLARATION
+date: <YYYY-MM-DD>
+operator: <identity>
+scope: baseline/ package + policy/ + schemas/ + tools/release/ + tests/
+head_commit: <commit id>
+anchor: audit/BOOTSTRAP_ANCHOR.txt
+checks: opa 7/7, pytest all pass, skills 5/5, placeholder DENY
+statement: From this point the frozen tree is immutable. Changes require a new
+           freeze cycle per baseline/BASELINE_PIPELINE.md phase 10.
+signature: <operator signature procedure per local policy>
+```
+
+## 7. Post-freeze verification
+
+```bash
+# anchor file exists and references the current HEAD
+cat audit/BOOTSTRAP_ANCHOR.txt
+git rev-parse HEAD
+
+# re-run the full checklist against the frozen tree
+opa test policy/ -v && python3 -m pytest tests/ -v && python3 scripts/validate_skills.py
+python3 tools/release/gate_check.py examples/placeholder_evidence_bundle.json || echo "placeholder DENY confirmed"
+```
+
+Record verification results in the ledger. Any mismatch → unfreeze is not
+possible; instead declare the freeze void and start a new cycle.
